SUMMARY:Free Open House of the Canadian Opera Company  (Osgoode Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you w
 ill need to register for your complimentary ticket in advance\, as they wi
 ll likely sell out. I also have two tickets for members.**\n\nOn **Saturda
 y September 5th\, join us for A Free Open House of the Canadian Opera Comp
 any at the Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts!** Explore one of t
 he world's greatest performance venues\, discover what goes on behind the 
 scenes\, and experience the creativity that brings opera to life.\n\nExplo
 re the building at your own pace with a self-guided tour\, step into the s
 potlight at our **photo station**\, enjoy bite-sized **live performances**
  from our talented artists\, **make a fun memento** of your visit\, and ge
 t up close with the costumes and props that bring our stories to life on s
 tage. Plus: every scanned ticket is entered into a draw for some incredibl
 e prizes that include a **VIP Opera Experience**! This is your chance to s
 tep inside\, ask questions\, and experience the Canadian Opera Company in 
 a relaxed\, welcoming setting. **Purchase A Free Open House of the Canadia
 n Opera Company on September 5th at 4pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: Free\n\nM
 eetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **S
 imply RSVP Yes**\n* If you'd like one of the extra tickets\, please messag
 e me or post a comment. (No shows are ineligible).\n* **Once you [purchase
 ](https://my.coc.ca/2686?_gl=1*13k89dn*_gcl_au*MTM4ODgzNDgyOC4xNzgzOTU3MTk
 0) your free ticket and post you have your ticket\, and I will move you to
  attending.**\n* A reminder will go out the day before with my cell and de
 tails when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐------
 -----\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 3:50pm** **along the right glass wal
 l\, after scanning your tickets and entering The Four Seasons Centre for t
 he Performing Arts at 145 Queen St. W.**\n\n**Start time: 4pm**\n\nLength:
  1 hour\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
