SUMMARY:Virtual: Canadian International Air Show Live in Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: You can come and go any time throu
 ghout the event and I recommend casting to your TV**\n\nOn **Sunday\, Sept
 ember 6th Long Weekend\,** **Celebrate North America's longest running air
  show at the 77th edition of the Canadian International Air Show.** The sh
 ow happens live in Toronto from noon to 3:40pm and viewers will be able to
  select a narration-only stream or a live video stream. Both options will 
 be made available to the public on the homepage on the show weekend. In ad
 dition to the line up of **[performers](https://www.cias.org/performers/)*
 *\, the Royal Canadian Air Force Griffon will be performing a Search and R
 escue (SAR) demonstration. See the tactical agility and power of the SAR's
  workhorse utility helicopter up close. Noteworthy\, Friday is a practice 
 day\, where you can see them running tests in the air. Enjoy!\n\n**COST**\
 nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* Click on this **[link](htt
 ps://www.cias.org/)** to see the show live\n* **Start time: performance ta
 kes place between 12 noon - 3:40pm**\n* RSVPs close at start time\n\nEnjoy
  and please post your Comments after!
