SUMMARY:The Invite Comedy/Drama/Romance 96% RT + Dinner (Varsity)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Monday September 7th\,** let's see **
 The Invite\, still in theatres after launching 2 months ago**. Joe and Ang
 ela's marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs n
 eighbors for a dinner party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Ha
 ve they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down? **My 
 seat is J13. Purchase your tickets for The Invite on Monday September 7th 
 for the Regular Show at 2:25pm at Cineplex Varsity.**\n\n**COST**\n$15.25 
 or CineClub $10.99 + fees\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes confirm
 ing Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **[Purchase](https://www.cineplex.com
 /movie/the-invite?ic=cpx_search_grid)** **your own ticket by selecting Get
  Tickets\, Monday September 7th\, Cineplex Varsity\, Regular Show at 2:25p
 m\, and post your seat number as a Comment**\n* You can also meet the grou
 p at the meetup time with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close same day\n\n*
 *MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 2:25pm in front of Auditorium 7\, inside Cin
 eplex Varsity in Manulife Centre at 55 Bloor St. W. after scanning your ti
 cket**\n\n**Show starts**: 2:25pm\n\nLength: 1 hour 47 minutes\n\nAfter: m
 eet me outside **Auditorium 7** to head out for dinner and chat about the 
 movie\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the event after.
