 oon for matinee performances at coc.ca (please ask for code) or 11am in pe
 rson at the Four Seasons Centre Box Office at 145 Queen St. W. All rush ti
 cket sales are final and cannot be refunded\, exchanged or replaced.\n\nSt
 anding Room: Approximately 60 are available in-person at 11 a.m. on the da
 y of a performance for just $15! They are located in the back rows of Ring
  3 (some may be SURTITLES™ obstructed) and Ring 4\, each with a hook and
  a leaning rail.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and n
 on-refundable.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https
